  "idea": "AI design feedback translator that turns vague feedback into clear edits",
  "text": "How to handle difficult freelance feedback without losing your mind. Receiving harsh, disorganized revision notes from stressful clients triggers immediate frustration and stalls project momentum. Freelancers get stuck because emotional reactions make it difficult to identify the legitimate product critique buried inside. Pasting unedited client critiques into a Claude persona prompt filters emotional noise into objective, task-oriented design instructions. You deliver perfect client revisions with total emotional detachment.",
